      "id": "claim_3de9ef0f8f5b4135b5f156273d6f4681",
      "statement": "The meeting-record pattern for a new transcribed meeting has four steps: the source transcript goes untouched into docs/sources/, a factual Portuguese summary with no analysis goes into docs/checkpoints/, cross-cutting reflections in English by default go into a discussion/<slug>-reflections.md note that updates whatever it resolves or corroborates, and any prior diary entry that flagged the meeting as pending gets updated rather than only appending a new entry.",
